# Benchmark: arithmetic
# Workload: 400 rounds of chained arithmetic (plus, minus, times, divided by)
# on numbers. Measures expression evaluation and assignment, nothing else.

total is 0
count from 1 to 400 as n
    a1 is n plus 7
    a2 is a1 times 3
    a3 is a2 minus n
    a4 is a3 divided by 2
    total is total plus a4
.
say "arithmetic total" total
